   └─ scope
      └─ paths: src/.test/assets/example.targets/*.ts

🔭 metrics.expected
   ├─ files
   │  ├─ rules: <n>
   │  └─ targets: <n>
   ├─ tokens
   │  ├─ estimate: <n>
   │  └─ context: <pct>
   └─ cost
      └─ estimate: <price>

🪵 logs
   ├─ scope: .log/bhrain/review/<stamp>/input.scope.json
   ├─ metrics: .log/bhrain/review/<stamp>/metrics.expected.json
   └─ tokens: .log/bhrain/review/<stamp>/tokens.expected.md
      ├─ rules: src (167, <pct>)
      └─ targets: src (99, <pct>)

🔍 what do we have here then?

<spinner>

✨ metrics.realized
   ├─ tokens
   │  ├─ input: <n>
   │  ├─ cache.set: <n>
   │  ├─ cache.get: <n>
   │  ├─ output: <n>
   │  └─ total: <n>
   ├─ cost
   │  └─ total: <price>
   └─ time
      └─ total: <ms>

<verdict>

🔍 review
